  "-248679781": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 797841370,
   "actor": "V_Freya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "This place is just old people and shit. What am I even supposed to do?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1878735499": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 797841370,
   "actor": "V_Liam",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Freya, it’s not about the people. Look around—the beach is beautiful, the air is fresh... I thought it’d be good for you to unwind.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1842546371": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 797841370,
   "actor": "V_Freya",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Unwind? At this snoozefest? Dad, I’m 22, not 60! I don’t want to spend my time sipping iced tea and listening to retirees talk about their golf scores.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1440914642": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 797841370,
   "actor": "V_Liam",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I just thought... you’ve been so stressed, and maybe this would help you relax.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2144392614": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 797841370,
   "actor": "V_Freya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "There you go again, trying to spin this like it’s all for me. You’re totally gaslighting me right now, {D}!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "939246494": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 797841370,
   "actor": "V_Liam",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Freya, that’s not true. I care about you. I just wanted to do something nice for us, that’s all.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1743424552": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 797841370,
   "actor": "V_Freya",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Ugh, do you even hear yourself? You always do this—you make it sound like you’re doing something for me, but it’s all about what you think I need!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-843167003": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 797841370,
   "actor": "V_Freya",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "And then, when I don’t go along with it, you act all hurt and misunderstood.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "958243008": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 797841370,
   "actor": "V_Freya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I need a drink. On my own.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
